{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0244_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "871a554a04d6f72685e952e4a66eb78a8d912cfb8332f86f554d1360d01a0604", "ja": "まったく……女王様相手に塩対応過ぎだよ！\nほらほら～、もっと言うことあるっしょ～♪", "zh": "真是的……对女王大人也太冷淡了吧！\n快说快说～你还有更多该说的话吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
